exports[`held for the DM peer's card alone 1`] = `
"Held — @richard's profile is not in your current context yet. Your message has been saved as a draft (kept for 10 minutes).

DM peer @richard (human, Asia/Shanghai): Founder. Prefers short updates.
Equivalent: raft user info @richard

After reading it, choose one path.
To send the current draft unchanged:
  raft message send --send-draft --target "dm:@richard"
If what you just read already says what you meant to say, or makes your message unnecessary, send nothing.
"
`;

